WEBVTT

00:00:08.740 --> 00:00:11.580
I don't have anything like that!

00:00:11.580 --> 00:00:16.120
I don't have anything that I'd
give up my own life to protect.

00:00:17.990 --> 00:00:21.700
If I open you up...

00:00:23.620 --> 00:00:25.700
...will I get my hands on something like that?

00:00:34.870 --> 00:00:39.620
The results aren't very satisfactory
on an irregular like him.

00:00:41.870 --> 00:00:44.080
If you're going to do it, hurry up.

00:00:47.870 --> 00:00:51.160
If I use Harmony...

00:00:51.160 --> 00:00:54.950
...I'm sure Juzo will be mad.

00:00:54.950 --> 00:00:57.290
Even so, I...

00:01:02.540 --> 00:01:04.950
I want to save Juzo!

00:01:07.660 --> 00:01:11.490
That's my trigger.

00:01:11.490 --> 00:01:18.160
The trigger that the higher ups
and that guy used to always pull.

00:01:18.160 --> 00:01:22.080
You know what our mission is this time.

00:01:22.080 --> 00:01:26.370
We are supposed to eliminate Five and
ten other Gun Slave Units along with

00:01:26.370 --> 00:01:31.240
three Hands that are going
against the disposal order.

00:01:35.700 --> 00:01:39.450
I thought you'd come soon.

00:01:39.450 --> 00:01:45.830
I'm device 12. I go by Twelve.

00:01:45.830 --> 00:01:49.830
I was thinkin' of talking with you.

00:01:51.410 --> 00:01:56.490
Is that guy trustworthy?

00:01:56.490 --> 00:02:01.910
It won't be funny if we're surrounded
the second we step outside.

00:02:01.910 --> 00:02:04.370
No worries, Five.

00:02:04.370 --> 00:02:10.490
The moment we make it outta here will
be the moment of our birth as humans.

00:02:15.080 --> 00:02:18.870
We really made it out...

00:02:18.870 --> 00:02:22.330
Looks like it's time for us to say, "Babuu."

00:02:22.330 --> 00:02:25.660
What do you plan to do now?

00:02:28.950 --> 00:02:34.790
I see, that's you're answer, huh?

00:02:49.290 --> 00:02:52.580
That was the moment I
realized it for the first time.

00:02:53.700 --> 00:02:59.410
The fact that I never made a decision until now.

00:02:59.410 --> 00:03:06.450
I pushed all the decision making onto <i>him</i> .

00:03:06.450 --> 00:03:10.450
And, no matter who was pulling the trigger...

00:03:10.450 --> 00:03:14.740
...everything that seemed like
the doings of someone else...

00:03:18.200 --> 00:03:23.290
...was actually all done by me!

00:03:39.160 --> 00:03:44.290
The only people allowed to touch my
trigger are the ones I've accepted.

00:03:45.450 --> 00:03:47.830
Juzo.

00:03:47.830 --> 00:03:52.740
But you don't plan on accepting anyone do you?

00:03:52.740 --> 00:03:54.740
That's right.

00:03:54.740 --> 00:03:57.830
No, that ain't right.

00:03:57.830 --> 00:04:03.700
More than anyone else, I can't accept myself.

00:04:03.700 --> 00:04:10.620
That's why I can't let anyone pull my trigger.

00:04:13.870 --> 00:04:15.330
I know.

00:04:17.700 --> 00:04:21.700
I won't pull your trigger, Juzo.

00:04:21.700 --> 00:04:25.290
You need to pull that trigger yourself.

00:04:26.490 --> 00:04:31.660
My power, Harmony, is just
something to help you do that.

00:04:32.700 --> 00:04:36.330
At that time, you decided to trust me.

00:04:38.910 --> 00:04:42.540
It's my turn now, Juzo.

00:06:15.450 --> 00:06:19.700
Trigger Again

00:06:15.700 --> 00:06:22.290
The suspected rampage of Extendeds continues
as we receive reports of injured victims.

00:06:22.290 --> 00:06:26.160
Please evacuate immediately if you are nearby.

00:06:26.160 --> 00:06:30.200
Since the End of War Commemoration
Park is a symbol peace,

00:06:30.200 --> 00:06:32.990
there is also a chance
that this is a terrorist attack.

00:06:32.990 --> 00:06:36.620
All involved agencies are
pushing for a quick resolution.

00:06:32.990 --> 00:06:34.370
Terrorist attack?

00:06:34.370 --> 00:06:36.620
Spitzbergen again?

00:06:36.620 --> 00:06:40.080
In related news, the number of
terrorist attacks in the previous years...

00:06:41.240 --> 00:06:46.910
We only know that two Over-Extendeds
with gun heads are going on a rampage.

00:06:46.910 --> 00:06:49.490
The details are still unknown.

00:06:49.490 --> 00:06:52.450
There is a good chance that
Berühren is involved.

00:06:52.450 --> 00:06:58.040
Stand by so we can take control before
them and confirm the situation.

00:06:58.040 --> 00:07:01.580
Following the orders of Section
Chief Kronen who went in ahead,

00:07:01.580 --> 00:07:07.540
EMS has surrounded the park and
finished evacuating the citizens.

00:07:07.540 --> 00:07:09.450
Kronen did that?!

00:07:15.120 --> 00:07:20.490
Why?! Why have things come to this?!

00:07:21.790 --> 00:07:26.910
I only ordered them to
eliminate the professor. Why?!

00:07:26.910 --> 00:07:34.410
It will be terrible if a weapon like
that ever gets linked to Berühren!

00:07:34.410 --> 00:07:38.910
I must sweep this under the rug somehow!

00:07:40.660 --> 00:07:43.620
Transporting the injured is top priority!

00:07:43.620 --> 00:07:48.370
EMS can handle the Extendeds goin' beserk!

00:07:48.370 --> 00:07:49.950
Shit!

00:07:49.950 --> 00:07:53.330
Are they planning on startin' another war?

00:08:18.450 --> 00:08:19.910
It hurts.

00:08:21.580 --> 00:08:24.790
It seems you're trying pretty hard.

00:08:24.790 --> 00:08:29.330
But Juzo Inui slapped my hand away.

00:08:29.330 --> 00:08:33.290
There's no way to save him anymore.

00:08:33.290 --> 00:08:38.370
And now, Harmony has overheated
and is completely useless.

00:08:39.540 --> 00:08:43.120
What are you planning?

00:08:44.700 --> 00:08:47.990
I was chasing after the two of you.

00:08:47.990 --> 00:08:53.870
Berühren was hiding the existence of
that Gun Slave Unit very diligently.

00:08:53.870 --> 00:08:59.290
Yet, you're committing such a
terrorist-like attack in public like this.

00:08:59.290 --> 00:09:00.660
This situation, too.

00:09:00.660 --> 00:09:03.660
Is this the orders of your owners?

00:09:08.040 --> 00:09:09.240
Pepper.

00:09:17.870 --> 00:09:21.620
Berühren's private soldiers?

00:09:24.620 --> 00:09:27.450
We are in position. Your orders.

00:09:27.450 --> 00:09:29.370
It cannot be helped.

00:09:29.370 --> 00:09:34.700
We cannot ignore those who
bring losses to the corporation.

00:09:34.700 --> 00:09:40.910
Retrieve them before they cause
an even more shameful scene.

00:09:42.290 --> 00:09:44.790
Shit! Shit! Shit!

00:09:56.120 --> 00:10:02.660
Looks like their actions were
not the will of Berühren.

00:10:02.660 --> 00:10:05.330
The murder of professor Wachowski.

00:10:05.330 --> 00:10:08.240
The use of a Gun Slave Unit.

00:10:08.240 --> 00:10:11.160
As well as this act of destruction...

00:10:11.160 --> 00:10:15.700
It seems Berühren wants to
cover all of this up with force.

00:10:15.700 --> 00:10:18.410
What do you two plan to do?

00:10:24.120 --> 00:10:25.450
Seven!

00:10:25.450 --> 00:10:26.790
I'm fine.

00:10:41.330 --> 00:10:42.830
Don't run away!

00:10:45.080 --> 00:10:47.080
I'm still...

00:10:50.200 --> 00:10:51.540
Pepper?

00:11:05.160 --> 00:11:07.080
These guys...

00:11:16.870 --> 00:11:19.290
Great.

00:11:19.290 --> 00:11:21.450
This is great!

00:11:21.450 --> 00:11:23.080
They're all watching!

00:11:23.080 --> 00:11:25.290
Looking at me!

00:11:25.290 --> 00:11:27.240
I can feel it!

00:11:27.240 --> 00:11:29.450
I feel connected to the world!

00:11:29.450 --> 00:11:30.660
Pepper!

00:11:32.950 --> 00:11:36.950
I wanted someone to praise me.

00:11:36.950 --> 00:11:40.450
I wanted someone to be by my side.

00:11:40.450 --> 00:11:42.080
I wanted...

00:11:42.080 --> 00:11:45.080
...someone to look at me.

00:11:45.080 --> 00:11:46.080
Pepper.

00:11:46.080 --> 00:11:48.660
We have to hurry and escape.

00:11:48.660 --> 00:11:51.410
Seven. This is an order.

00:11:52.740 --> 00:11:54.290
Destroy it.

00:11:54.290 --> 00:11:56.160
Everything.

00:11:56.160 --> 00:12:01.540
Make it so they'll never
look away from me again.

00:12:01.540 --> 00:12:04.990
If that's what you wish for, I'll...

00:12:15.580 --> 00:12:17.540
Pepper!

00:12:17.540 --> 00:12:20.660
Hit. Hand over the next arrow.

00:12:22.580 --> 00:12:23.950
Pepper!

00:12:58.200 --> 00:12:59.990
Those two...

00:13:04.830 --> 00:13:08.620
I'm Pepper's gun!

00:13:10.540 --> 00:13:12.370
So, watch.

00:13:14.700 --> 00:13:17.990
I'll be the one to make Pepper's wish come true.

00:13:17.990 --> 00:13:20.330
Shit! Too far!

00:13:25.740 --> 00:13:32.040
Juzo, you rejected the idea that
you were a weapon... A tool.

00:13:34.370 --> 00:13:41.580
You decided to only use your powers
for people who needed your help.

00:13:41.580 --> 00:13:49.240
But that's the very reason why, right now,
you need to be the one to pull your own trigger.

00:13:49.240 --> 00:13:51.410
For your own sake!

00:13:56.410 --> 00:14:00.200
My own sake...

00:14:02.700 --> 00:14:04.580
You're not my tool.

00:14:04.580 --> 00:14:08.580
Much less the tool of the command center.

00:14:08.580 --> 00:14:13.580
You decide what you want to do, Juzo.

00:14:14.990 --> 00:14:19.080
My... wish.

00:14:51.620 --> 00:14:56.370
Local conflict impeachment
configuration conversion complete.

00:14:56.370 --> 00:14:58.160
The bullet...

00:14:58.160 --> 00:15:00.490
The wish...

00:15:00.490 --> 00:15:02.490
...has been loaded.

00:15:06.620 --> 00:15:11.450
How in the world...?

00:15:13.080 --> 00:15:15.870
I don't really care about the logic.

00:15:15.870 --> 00:15:20.580
I guess you could call it the
stubbornness of an adult.

00:15:20.580 --> 00:15:26.240
You see, I arrogantly gave that
kid a lecture a little while back.

00:15:26.240 --> 00:15:31.450
He threw those words I spouted
right back into my face.

00:15:32.910 --> 00:15:36.120
So you were saved by a kid like that?

00:15:36.120 --> 00:15:38.290
How pathetic.

00:15:38.290 --> 00:15:40.790
True, it's a pathetic story.

00:15:40.790 --> 00:15:44.790
But it's a little different
from being saved, per se.

00:15:46.580 --> 00:15:50.240
After the great war, I made a
name for myself as a resolver,

00:15:50.240 --> 00:15:54.240
hiding behind my deeds of helping
the wishes of others come true,

00:15:54.240 --> 00:15:58.450
so that I wouldn't have to
fight for my own wishes.

00:15:59.870 --> 00:16:07.330
If you make a wish come true, you gotta
accept everything that comes with it, too.

00:16:09.120 --> 00:16:15.240
If you want to stand by your words,
no matter what others say,

00:16:15.240 --> 00:16:17.620
you've got to show resolve!

00:16:20.450 --> 00:16:28.870
I told him all that, but I didn't
have any resolve, myself.

00:16:29.790 --> 00:16:36.490
That kid pushed me forward from
behind with that little body of his.

00:16:36.490 --> 00:16:39.830
He told me, "You can't run away forever."

00:16:42.040 --> 00:16:44.580
Well, you know...

00:16:44.580 --> 00:16:49.910
An adult has got to show his good
side when a kid goes that far.

00:16:53.950 --> 00:16:59.990
I don't want you to go down
the same path I did in the past.

00:17:02.330 --> 00:17:07.160
I don't know what kind of orders
made you go on a rampage,

00:17:07.160 --> 00:17:12.370
but your precious master is gonna die
if you don't get her treated quickly.

00:17:15.990 --> 00:17:19.740
Pepper told me to destroy it all.

00:17:19.740 --> 00:17:22.240
So, that's what I'll do.

00:17:23.700 --> 00:17:27.200
Is that your wish?

00:17:29.040 --> 00:17:32.790
It's true that we were made to be tools.

00:17:34.040 --> 00:17:39.700
It's just... we finally made it through tha war.

00:17:39.700 --> 00:17:44.580
It doesn't hurt to enjoy life a little.

00:17:46.450 --> 00:17:51.740
But that doesn't mean that others
have the right to use you.

00:17:54.290 --> 00:17:57.240
I'll ask one more time.

00:17:57.240 --> 00:18:02.620
Is that really what you want, Seven?!

00:18:14.540 --> 00:18:16.370
You dare say that?

00:18:18.160 --> 00:18:22.830
You dare... talk about my wish?!

00:18:36.490 --> 00:18:38.540
Damn.

00:18:38.540 --> 00:18:44.080
Now I see how <i>he</i> probably saw me back then.

00:18:55.620 --> 00:18:57.620
Can't be helped.

00:18:57.620 --> 00:19:00.450
We both have inefficient bodies.

00:19:00.450 --> 00:19:02.620
Let's be quick about this.

00:19:13.830 --> 00:19:17.160
Gewitter Nagel!

00:19:17.160 --> 00:19:20.040
Funke Faust!

00:19:24.290 --> 00:19:26.200
Doppel Zwei!

00:19:40.200 --> 00:19:48.700
There's no way I'd lose to someone who
got their trigger pulled by a fake Hands.

00:19:48.700 --> 00:19:52.490
Tetsuro isn't a Hands that stands behind me.

00:19:54.580 --> 00:19:58.450
He's a friend who faces me.

00:19:59.580 --> 00:20:03.330
You and me.

00:20:03.330 --> 00:20:07.450
This is the difference between a
Gun Slave Unit with and without a shooter.

00:20:19.040 --> 00:20:24.870
Device 7 and Device 13
have fulfilled their roles well.

00:20:25.950 --> 00:20:31.120
There were some unexpected scenarios
due the the action of the Hands,

00:20:31.120 --> 00:20:33.660
but all within calculations.

00:20:33.660 --> 00:20:39.580
Their contact has allowed Tetsuro to
pull away from Harmony's original functions.

00:20:39.580 --> 00:20:44.040
Showing much more potential
than our original expectations.

00:20:44.040 --> 00:20:46.910
Truly amazing.

00:20:46.910 --> 00:20:50.080
True. We've had fantastic results.

00:20:50.080 --> 00:20:55.540
However, we have been unsuccessful
in duplicating Harmony.

00:20:55.540 --> 00:21:01.200
How long do we plan to leave such
an irreplaceable original loose?

00:21:02.910 --> 00:21:05.910
It is time.

00:21:05.910 --> 00:21:11.790
The "original" shall be returned
to the hands of Berühren.

00:21:11.790 --> 00:21:13.290
Wait.

00:21:15.540 --> 00:21:22.330
We have not fully explored
the abilities of Harmony.

00:21:23.580 --> 00:21:27.830
I wish to observe a little longer.

00:21:27.830 --> 00:21:35.120
I want to see how far his powers grow
as he struggles at the very bottom.

00:21:36.790 --> 00:21:44.790
Master Tetsuro... The one who
holds Astraea's golden scales.

00:21:44.790 --> 00:21:49.910
I do hope those scales tilt into our hands.

00:23:27.410 --> 00:23:30.490
I'm not the one who decides that.

00:23:28.910 --> 00:23:32.740
All of you are looking down on me!

00:23:30.490 --> 00:23:35.160
I'm only doing the job that
I've accepted from him.

00:23:31.200 --> 00:23:32.740
Juzo.

00:23:32.740 --> 00:23:35.160
You need someone like that.

00:23:35.160 --> 00:23:41.870
<i>NO GUNS LIFE</i> . Episode 24.
"Earnest Desire."
